+++ b/changelog/69946.added.md
@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+Added a ``beacons.status`` execution module function that reports, for each
+configured beacon, when it last actually fired and whether that firing
+raised an error. Status is read live from the minion's running beacon
+process, so it reflects real activity without waiting for a new probe
+cycle, reading logs, or restarting the minion. Beacons that have not fired
+yet are reported as such.
